# CCAO-F Practice Set 04 — Claude Certified Associate – Foundations

Written against the official Exam Guide v1.0 (July 2026). Original practice items, not exam
content. 60 questions · 120 minutes · domain-grouped · ~60% Advanced / ~40% Expert · 8
select-TWO items. No situation repeats Sets 01–03 or Purcell's practice exam. Every wrong
option is a real practice; the answer under each question says where it would be right.

| Domain | Weight | Items |
|---|---|---|
| 1 Prompting and Task Execution | 14% | 8 |
| 2 Output Evaluation and Validation | 21% | 13 |
| 3 Product and Model Selection | 12% | 7 |
| 4 Workflow Integration and Solution Design | 16% | 10 |
