</details>

### Question 2.8 · Expert · Multiple choice · select ONE

A sales team needs a plain-language version of the legal terms in a new service agreement,
so reps can answer customer questions. What is the best approach?

**A.** Simplify the terms with Claude, then send them to the reps.

